-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה — the vocabulary its sections share.
-- Only what more than one section uses lives here; a section's own terms
-- live in its own file, beside the clause that coins them.

IMPORT parties

§ `תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה — אוצר מילים משותף`

@desc A school year runs from 1 September; months are counted from it, so 1 is September and 10 is June.
DECLARE `school month` IS ONE OF
    September, October, November, December, January, February,
    March, April, May, June, July, August

GIVEN m IS A `school month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `month number` m IS
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN September THEN 1
    WHEN October   THEN 2
    WHEN November  THEN 3
    WHEN December  THEN 4
    WHEN January   THEN 5
    WHEN February  THEN 6
    WHEN March     THEN 7
    WHEN April     THEN 8
    WHEN May       THEN 9
    WHEN June      THEN 10
    WHEN July      THEN 11
    WHEN August    THEN 12

-- §3.3.16 and §3.7.3(3) print the same rule: a teacher full-time in two
-- schools or more is made an educator only where she has most of her hours.
GIVEN `full-time in two schools or more` IS A BOOLEAN, `this school has most of her hours` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be made an educator in this school` `full-time in two schools or more` `this school has most of her hours` IF
    (NOT `full-time in two schools or more`) OR `this school has most of her hours`
